Nova's smart routing automatically assigns incoming tickets to the right queue based on your team's own history.

- **How it learns** — uses past assignments and current team load, not a generic model, to decide where tickets should go [1].
- **Impact** — teams typically see unassigned-ticket time drop by half in the first month [1].
- **Availability** — ships as part of Nova on the Business and Enterprise plans, and activates automatically once a workspace has 30 days of ticket history (cold-start mode with category defaults until then) [2].

